jobs.description:
What will you do?

As a Production Employee, you will support the manufacturing and packaging of various bakery products, such as filled cookies, stroopwafels, and almond cookies.

Your main tasks will include:

- Supporting and operating production lines;
- Supplying materials and ingredients;
- Checking product quality;
- Packing finished products;
- Reporting faults or irregularities;
- Cleaning machines and keeping the workplace organized;
- Supporting colleagues when needed.
- Your tasks may vary depending on the production schedule, so every day brings new responsibilities and experience.

We are looking for candidates who are:

- Motivated, reliable, and responsible;
- Available to work in a 3-shift system;
- Equipped with their own accommodation and transport;
- Experienced in production (preferred, but not essential);
- Quality-focused and able to work accurately;
- Physically fit and comfortable with practical work;
- Flexible, quick to adapt, and able to stay calm under pressure;
- Comfortable working independently and as part of a team;
- Able to communicate in English at a basic or good level.

Working Hours

The position follows a 3-shift rotation:

- Night: 11:15 PM – 7:00 AM
- Morning: 7:00 AM – 3:15 PM
- Afternoon: 3:15 PM – 11:15 PM

As a Production Worker, no two days are the same! You’ll take on a variety of tasks such as operating the production line, packing and unpacking products, and monitoring progress. Notice a minor malfunction? You’ll take care of it right away. You’ll also make sure that pallets and products are properly labeled and that your workspace stays clean and organized. In addition, there’s an opportunity to work in other departments, making your job even more diverse and dynamic.

What we ask from you:

- Are you available to start full-time right away? Perfect!
-  You bring a positive attitude and help create a great atmosphere at work;
-  You’re physically fit and enjoy being active throughout the day;
-  You speak good English – if you also speak Polish, that’s a plus;
-  Working neatly and accurately comes naturally to you.
